      "page": 209,
      "ruku": 172,
      "hizbQuarter": 83,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1374,
      "text": "Their prayer will be, “Glorify be to You, O Allah,” and their greeting will be, “Peace,” and the closing of their prayer will be, “All praise be to Allah, the Lord of the worlds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 209,
      "ruku": 172,
      "hizbQuarter": 83,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1375,
      "text": "If Allah were to hasten evil[14] to the people, just as they seek to hasten good[15], they would have been ruined. But We leave those who do not expect to meet Us to wander blindly in their transgression.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 209,
      "ruku": 173,
      "hizbQuarter": 84,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1376,
      "text": "When hardship befalls man, he calls upon Us, whether lying on his side, sitting or standing. But when We remove his hardship, he turns a blind eye as though he had never called upon Us to remove his hardship[16]. This is how the misdeeds of the transgressors are made appealing to them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 209,
      "ruku": 173,
      "hizbQuarter": 84,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1377,
      "text": "We destroyed the generations[17] before you when they indulged in wrongdoing, and their messengers came to them with clear proofs, but they would not believe. This is how We recompense the wicked people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 209,
      "ruku": 173,
      "hizbQuarter": 84,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1378,
      "text": "Then We made you their successors in the land to see how you would behave[18].",
